  data: {
    LLM: '1. Players draw from the stock or claim the latest discard.\n2. **Claiming**: You can only take the discard if you can immediately use it to complete a set or run on the table.\n3. **Melding**: Players lay down valid combinations:\n   - **Set**: 3 or 4 cards of the same rank (different suits).\n   - **Run**: 3 or more consecutive cards of the same suit.\n4. **Discarding**: Every turn must end with a discard.',
    Player: '1. Players draw from the stock or claim the latest discard.\n2. **Claiming**: You can only take the discard if you can immediately use it to complete a set or run on the table.\n3. **Melding**: Players lay down valid combinations:\n   - **Set**: 3 or 4 cards of the same rank (different suits).\n   - **Run**: 3 or more consecutive cards of the same suit.\n4. **Discarding**: Every turn must end with a discard.',
    objective: "Form all cards into sets and runs to empty your hand ('Remi'). If the deck runs out, the player with the lowest score wins.",
    gameplay: '1. Players draw from the stock or claim the latest discard.\n2. **Claiming**: You can only take the discard if you can immediately use it to complete a set or run on the table.\n3. **Melding**: Players lay down valid combinations:\n   - **Set**: 3 or 4 cards of the same rank (different suits).\n   - **Run**: 3 or more consecutive cards of the same suit.\n4. **Discarding**: Every turn must end with a discard.',
    keyRules: [
      'Draw or claim discard (only if immediate meld).',
      'Set: 3-4 same rank. Run: 3+ same suit.',
      'Remi = go out with whole hand at once; bonus.',
      "Minus pts for dead cards in others' hands.",
